.SS "int32_t schultz_font_resolve (const \fBschultz_font_system\fP * system, \fBschultz_handle\fP handle, \fBschultz_font\fP ** out_font)"

.PP
Resolves a font handle to its representation\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIsystem\fP The system holding the font\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.br
\fIhandle\fP The font handle to resolve\&. 
.br
\fIout_font\fP Receives the font\&. Must not be NULL\&. The pointer is valid until the font is unloaded\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
SCHULTZ_OK, SCHULTZ_ERR_INVALID_ARGUMENT when a pointer is NULL, or SCHULTZ_ERR_INVALID_HANDLE when the handle names no loaded font\&. 
.RE
